  "sourceTitle": "I’m building an open-source browser agent that can run locally with LM Studio/Ollama — including a 450M browser VLM",
  "sourceBodyHash": "4cbc6e7480f29b091e130ea7cb9986a1c63a5b76e008d001357b467d2b85f3c3",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-CN",
  "translationVersion": "openrouter-zh-v2",
  "status": "complete",
  "importanceLevel": 5,
  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-29T13:24:48.357999Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-09-29T13:26:25.328007Z",
  "totalBlocks": 12,
  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23299be968d6c805",
      "translationZh": "我一直在开发一个名为 WebBrain 的开源项目，它赋予了大语言模型（LLM）看见和操作浏览器的能力。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f4f980a3f7c0ce",
      "translationZh": "我真正想要避免的一件事是让浏览器代理依赖于单一的云模型/提供商。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2bc14d8cdd9833e7",
      "translationZh": "因此，WebBrain 可以通过 LM Studio、Ollama 等工具使用本地模型，如果需要也可以使用云 API。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "caeca3da043ca5bb",
      "translationZh": "我还专门为浏览器任务训练了一个小型视觉模型：webbrain-vl-2-450M",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "afa3f70118a028cb",
      "translationZh": "它基于 LFM-2.5-VL-450M，并在浏览器截图/任务上进行了微调。其思想是：与其将每张截图发送给巨型多模态模型，不如在本地使用一个非常小的模型来完成部分浏览器感知。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27b94887d95c432c",
      "translationZh": "它可以直接在用户机器上通过 WebGPU 运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db3de0cf35847575",
      "translationZh": "该代理本身会将截图与浏览器的可访问性树结合，而不是完全依赖 DOM 解析。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3cafdd90d0eaeff1",
      "translationZh": "当前架构大致如下：• 截图 + 可访问性树 用于感知 • 在有用时使用浏览器专用的微型 VLM • 模型无关的规划器 • 通过 LM Studio/Ollama 使用本地模型 • 支持 Chrome / Edge / Firefox / Chromium • 可选的云执行 • 开源",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "014833de64b8920a",
      "translationZh": "我特别想弄清楚，在使用小型本地模型而不是 GPT/Claude 规模的模型时，浏览器代理实际上能走多远。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aae501b8d508e6ef",
      "translationZh": "仓库: https://github.com/webbrain-one/webbrain 模型: https://huggingface.co/webbrain-one/webbrain-vl-2-450M 数据集: https://huggingface.co/datasets/webbrain-one/webbrain-vl-2-450M-dataset",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "25b34628557b91b0",
      "translationZh": "非常希望在这里运行较小的 Qwen/LFM/MiniCPM 等模型的人们能提供反馈 — — 特别是您会尝试哪种模型作为规划器。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d1fba3a18f52baeb",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/ButtercupLyn100 提交",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    }
  ],
